            {
              "id": "1770424326138_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Analyze this user input: \" {{$context.$nodes.HUMAN_APPROVAL_FINAL.$feedbackRecieved}}\" and match with intent. User input may not be in English -- translate if needed (language: {{$context.$variables.language}})\n\nAny \"name\" should capitalize all major words and spaces instead of underscores.\n\nAny \"code\" is alphanumeric with underscores instead of spaces and no special characters.\n\nIf the intent is to change name and code, and they provide exact name to use, output: {option: \"CHANGE_CODE_AND_NAME\", name: <exact new name>, code: <code from name>}  \n\nIf the intent is to change name and does not provide the new name, output: {option: \"CHANGE_NAME\"}\n\nIf the intent is to change name and provide exact name to use, output: {option: \"CHANGE_NAME\", name: <exact new name>}  \n\nIf the intent is to change name and request change to name, use that plus Agent Team Info to generate the new name and output: {option: \"CHANGE_NAME\", name: <new name>}  \n\nIf the intent is to change code and does not provide the new code, output:  {option: \"CHANGE_CODE\" }\n\nIf the intent is to change code and provide exact code to use, output: {option: \"CHANGE_CODE\", code: <exact new code>}  \n\nIf the intent is to change code and request to change to code, use that plus Agent Team Info to generate the new code and output: {option: \"CHANGE_CODE\", code: <new code>}\n\n\nIf the intent is to start over or change family or product, output.  {option:  \"CHANGE_FAMILY_PRODUCT\", family: <if requested, family if valid family in FamilyAndProducts, default existing agent team family>, product: <if requested, product if valid product for the family in FamilyAndProducts; use LookupCode, default \"Other\">}\n\nIf the intent is to start over or change plan, output.  {option:  \"START_OVER\"}\n\nIf the intent is to RETRY and the user provides input for how to change the plan, output.  {option: \"RETRY_WITH_CHANGES\", changes: <users request changes>}. If intent is not provided, assume it is RETRY_WITH_CHANGES\n\nIf the intent is to RETRY , output  {option: \"RETRY\"}\n\nAgent Team info: {{$context.$nodes.AGENT_TEAM.$output.result}}\n\nFamilyAndProducts {{$context.$variables.familiesWithProduct}}"
            }
          ],
