            {
              "id": "1770835905706_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "# Instructions\nGiven a user message, create userRequest with these changes to the input\n- if the user message is not in English, translate it to english and set \"language\" to the original language\n- If the user is trying to set \"Family\" or \"Product\", remove these from the request and return them separately\n- If the user request wording along the lines of \"Create an agent\", \"create an agent team\", \"build an agent team\", or similar, remove that part of the request\n- This user request will be processed to create an agent team that may fetch values from rest calls. If it seems likely the created agent will want fetch from external sources, create the description/s of describing the purpose of what rest calls will be needed -- do not include a url. Keep the results minimal, only suggest one per need. Do not add rest call for sending email. \n\n\n# Input\nuser message: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}} \n\n# Output ==\nReturn JSON format:\n{\n  \"userRequest\": <the user's  request >,\n   \"family\": <family if available>,\n   \"product\": <product if available>,\n   \"restCalls\": <array of possible rest calls>\n   \"language\": <original language, default English>\n}"
            }
