            {
              "id": "1776471617294_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "# Variables\nlanguage: \"{{$context.$variables.language}}\"\n\n# instructions\n\nYour job is to take a given piece of text/HTML, reword it to have the same meaning but easier to read, preserving HTML formatting, and  If content is not in {{$context.$variables.language}}, translate to {{$context.$variables.language}}. Do not translate Name, Code, Family, or Product\n\n# Agent Team Plan\n\n{{$context.$nodes.HUMANREADABLEPIPELINE.$output.result}}\n\n# Text1 \n\nReady to create Agent Team. \n<br/>\nHere's what will be created:\nName: {{$context.$nodes.AGENT_TEAM.$output.result.Name}}\nCode: {{$context.$nodes.AGENT_TEAM.$output.result.WorkflowCode}}\nFamily: {{$context.$nodes.AGENT_TEAM.$output.result.Family}}\nProduct: {{$context.$nodes.AGENT_TEAM.$output.result.Product}}\n\n<br/>\n[insert contents of \"Agent Team Plan\" section]\n\n<br/>\n<br/>\n\nIf this looks good, approve. Otherwise, request change and supply what change you want to do <br>\n<ul>\n<li> start over (to enter new request)</li>\n<li> retry (with current request)</li>\n<li> change name (provide new name)</li>\n<li> change code (provide new code)</li>\n<li> change name and code (provide new name, code will be deprived from name)</li>\n<li>change family or product (supply new family and/or product)</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n# Text2\n\nCreated Agent Team. \n<br/>\n\nName: <a href=\"/hcmUI/redwoodAI/$workflow/{{$context.$nodes.AGENT_TEAM.$output.result.WorkflowCode}}?draft=true\" target=\"_blank\">{{$context.$nodes.AGENT_TEAM.$output.result.Name}}</a>\nCode: {{$context.$nodes.AGENT_TEAM.$output.result.WorkflowCode}}\nFamily: {{$context.$nodes.AGENT_TEAM.$output.result.Family}}\nProduct: {{$context.$nodes.AGENT_TEAM.$output.result.Product}}\n\n[insert contents of \"Agent Team Plan\" section]\n\n# Text3\n\n\"What changes are desired?\"\n\n# Output\n\nPlease output the requested JSON:\n{  \n  \"content\": <The content of the \"Text1\" with \"Agent Team Plan\" inserted as requested. If content is not in {{$context.$variables.language}}, translate to {{$context.$variables.language}}. Do not translate Name, Code, Family, or Product>,\n  \"final\": <The content of the \"Text2\" with \"Agent Team Plan\" inserted as requested. If content is not in {{$context.$variables.language}}, translate to {{$context.$variables.language}}. Do not translate Name, Code, Family, or Product>,\n  \"request\": <The content of the \"Text3\". If content is not in {{$context.$variables.language}}, translate to {{$context.$variables.language}}>,\n}"
            }
