          "code": "MATCH_EXISTING_TOOLS",
          "id": "1778269677088",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1778269677088_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "# Variables\nNodes with Business Objects Functions: {{$context.$nodes.FINDBODESC.$output.result.boNodesForKBExisting}}\nNodes Missing Business Objects Functions: {{$context.$nodes.FINDBODESC.$output.result.boNodesForKB}}\nBusinessObjectFunctions (format each business object is a string, :: is the separator between businessObjectFunctions :: BusinessObjectCode/FunctionName/BusinessObjectDescription/FunctionDescription/InputParmeters:InputName,Input DataType/... ): {{$context.$nodes.FINDBODESC.$output.result.bofsForAllMatching}}}\n\n# Output\n\nReturn the combination of \"Nodes with Business Objects Functions\" and \"Nodes Missing Business Objects Functions\"\n\n## node entries for \"Nodes with Business Objects Functions\"\n\nForeach node in nodes, add an entry in return array \"nodesWith\" with these fields: \n\n| Field Name | Value |\n| -------- | -------- |\n| code | node.code |\n| OutputAttributes |  node.kbBo.OutputAttributes or node.externalRestTool.InputParmeters | \n| parametersMapping |  See \"parametersMapping\" section | \n| outputMapping |  See \"outputMapping\" section | \n\n## node entries for \"Nodes Missing Business Objects Functions\"\n\nForeach node in \"Nodes Missing Business Objects Functions\", examine node.characteristic and see  BusinessObjectFunctions variable that is close match to what node.characteristic describes and dd an entry to the return array \"nodesWithOut\" these fields:\n\n| Field Name | Value |\n| -------- | -------- |\n| code | node.code |\n| BusinessObjectCode | BusinessObjectCode |\n| FunctionName | FunctionName |\n| OutputAttributes |  node.kbBo.OutputAttributes or node.externalRestTool.InputParmeters | \n| parametersMapping |  See \"parametersMapping\" section | \n| outputMapping |  See \"outputMapping\" section | \n\n## parametersMapping\n\nForeach item in InputParameters (node.kbBo.InputParmeters or node.externalRestTool.InputParmeters):\n - match with node.inputs on type match and name similarity and return {param_name: <parameter name attribute>, name: <input name>, code: <input code>, type: <parameter type>, value: <input value>, source: <input source>}. Each entry in node.inputs should only ever be matched once\n- If no close match, assess node.characteristic to see if a static value would work for this parameter. If so, return {param_name: <parameter name attribute>, name: null, code: null, type: <parameter type>, value: <static value>, source: \"kb_static\"} \n- if neither match nor static, return {param_name: <parameter name attribute>, name: null, code: null, type: <parameter type>, value: null, source: null}.\n\n## outputMapping\n\n If node.outputs has a child \"restResults\" with a children attribute, identify as restResultsChildren, foreach item in restResultsChildren, match with item im OutputAttributes, and return  {outputName: <output attribute name if match exist>, name: <restResultsChildren child name >, type: <output attribute DataType>. If restResultsChildren child name is id and there is no match, look for an id field in OutputAttributes that is likely a main id for the object and match on that."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n   \"$schema\":\"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n   \"type\":\"object\",\n   \"properties\":{\n      \"nodesWith\":{\n         \"type\":\"array\",\n         \"items\":{\n            \"type\":\"object\",\n            \"properties\":{\n               \"code\":{\n                  \"type\":\"string\"\n               },\n               \"OutputAttributes\":{\n                  \"type\":\"array\"\n               },\n               \"parametersMapping\":{\n                  \"type\":\"array\"\n               },\n               \"outputMapping\":{\n                  \"type\":\"array\"\n               },\n               \"input\":{\n                  \"type\":\"array\"\n               }\n            }\n         }\n      },\n\n      \"nodesWithOut\":{\n         \"type\":\"array\",\n         \"items\":{\n            \"type\":\"object\",\n            \"properties\":{\n               \"code\":{\n                  \"type\":\"string\"\n               },\n                \"BusinessObjectCode\":{\n                  \"type\":\"string\"\n               },\n                \"FunctionName\":{\n                  \"type\":\"string\"\n               },\n               \"OutputAttributes\":{\n                  \"type\":\"array\"\n               },\n               \"parametersMapping\":{\n                  \"type\":\"array\"\n               },\n               \"outputMapping\":{\n                  \"type\":\"array\"\n               },\n               \"input\":{\n                  \"type\":\"array\"\n               }\n            }\n         }\n      }\n\n   }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Process Existing Matches",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "const nodesforExisting = $context.$nodes.FINDBODESC.$output.result.boNodesForKBExisting;\nconst nodesMissingKb = $context.$nodes.FINDBODESC.$output.result.boNodesForKB;\nconst matchOutput = $context.$nodes.MATCH_EXISTING_TOOLS.$output.nodesWith.concat($context.$nodes.MATCH_EXISTING_TOOLS.$output.nodesWithOut);\nconst minBusinessObjectFunctionsAll = $context.$variables.minBusinessObjectFunctionsAll || {};\n\nconst missingNodes = [];\nconst matchOutputByCode = {};\n\nconst toProcess = nodesforExisting.concat(nodesMissingKb);\n\nif (!toProcess || !matchOutput) {\n  return;\n}\nfor (const node of matchOutput) {\n  matchOutputByCode[node.code] = node;\n}\nconst nodesByCode = [];\nfor (const node of toProcess) {\n  nodesByCode[node.code] = node;\n  const match = matchOutputByCode[node.code];\n  let parametersMapping;\n  let restObj;\n  if (!node.kbBo && match && match.BusinessObjectCode && match.FunctionName) {\n    const matchKey = match.BusinessObjectCode + \":\" + match.FunctionName ;\n    if (minBusinessObjectFunctionsAll[matchKey]) {\n      node.kbBo = minBusinessObjectFunctionsAll[matchKey];\n    } else {\n      node.notFound = matchKey;\n    }\n  }\n  if (match && node.kbBo) {\n    let kbBo = node.kbBo;\n    node.businessObjectFunction = node.kbBo;\n    node.businessObjectFunction.parameters = [];\n    for (const param of kbBo.InputParmeters) {\n      node.businessObjectFunction.parameters.push({\n        name: param.Name,\n        dataType: param.DataType,\n      });\n    }\n\n    node.businessObjectFunction.parametersMapping = match.parametersMapping;\n    parametersMapping = node.businessObjectFunction.parametersMapping;\n    restObj = node.businessObjectFunction;\n    delete node.kbBo;\n  } else if (match && node.externalRestTool) {\n    node.externalRestTool.parametersMapping = match.parametersMapping;\n    restObj = node.externalRestTool;\n    parametersMapping = match.parametersMapping;\n  } else {\n    missingNodes.push(node);\n    delete nodesByCode[node.code];\n  }\n  node.missingInputs = [];\n  if (parametersMapping) {\n    for (const param of parametersMapping) {\n      if (!param.source) {\n        node.missingInputs.push(param);\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  node.inputMissing = node.missingInputs.length > 0;\n\n  const outputAttributes = {}; \n  node.missingOutputs = [];\n  if (restObj) {\n    restObj.outputs = [];\n    if (restObj.OutputAttributes) {\n      for (const output of restObj.OutputAttributes) {\n        restObj.outputs.push({name: output.Name, type: output.DataType});\n        outputAttributes[output.Name] = output;\n      }\n    }\n    if (node.outputMapping) {\n      for (const output of node.outputMapping) {\n        if (output &&  (!output.outputName || !outputAttributes[output.outputName])) {\n          output.outputName = '';\n          node.missingOutputs.push(output);\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  node.outputMissing = node.missingOutputs.length > 0;\n}\n\nconst boNodesForKB = [];\n\nfor (const node of nodesMissingKb ) {\n  if (!nodesByCode[node.code]) {\n    boNodesForKB.push(node);\n  }\n}\n\nconst ret = {nodes: Object.values(nodesByCode), missingNodes, boNodesForKB};\n\nreturn ret;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1778271472994"
          },
          "code": "PROCESS_EXISTING_MATCHES",
          "id": "1778269935427",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
